#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:7
#: ac724ba3aac54da09c8d15248236ed80
msgid "Crop Sprayer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:9
#: 4b1ac36ddd0d4ef9a66009464e8fed7e
msgid "Copter includes support for a crop sprayer.  This feature allows an autopilot connected to a PWM operated pump and (optionally) spinner to control the rate of flow of liquid fertilizer based on the vehicle speed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:14
#: 5adf3ed469f94490bd5dd267af77125c
msgid "Slightly out-of-date video showing a copter using the Sprayer feature (jump to 2:25 to see the sprayer in action)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:16
#: 2e418bfc53634ff58dcaee84567410d8
msgid "Many boards with only 1MB of flash do not have this feature. See :ref:`Firmware Limitations <common-limited_firmware>` for a list of boards without this capability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:18
#: cf1d8057196b4804a2463367c3cdbb00
msgid "See also :ref:`Zig-Zag Mode <zigzag-mode>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:21
#: 863432fc25524804b98e064f314009e0
msgid "Required Hardware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:26
#: c3099adcdd5b43e0a28b34b38d6c1a33
msgid "A multicopter such as the `EnRoute AC 940-D <https://www.nttedt.co.jp/product?pgid=knya72d0-00609f8a-0b97-4818-be16-4d03a6ebf88a>`_ with a PWM controlled pump and optionally a PWM controlled spinning mechanism (EnRoute vehicle does not require this secondary spinner control)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:28
#: 6095a7ad83234188a71139fbc62f2096
msgid "The pump controls the rate of flow of the fertilizer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:30
#: 23b065c3d308494187bd3a0e1b486454
msgid "The optional spinner (rotary atomizer) should be attached to the end of the spraying nozzles and enables control over spray droplet size. Higher PWM, faster rotation, smaller droplets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:33
#: ea155a0caa714c9d92400bde89d3433b
msgid "Enabling the Sprayer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:35
#: 8daf838cc22a4fd08723f968bb11e694
msgid "Connect your autopilot to the ground station (i.e. Mission Planner)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:36
#: 35c509a0a49b412d96debde1f4dacd91
msgid "Set the :ref:`SPRAY_ENABLE <SPRAY_ENABLE>` parameter to 1 and refresh parameters (the sprayer is not a commonly used feature so its other parameters are initially hidden)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:37
#: 2f2dcc5eece249dda8246a05da8aa4cb
msgid "Connect the pump to one of the autopilot's PWM outputs (like Pixhawk AUX1) and set the appropriate SERVO*_FUNCTION  or RC*_FUNCTION to 22 (where \"*\" is the RC output number, i.e. if the pump is connected to a Pixhawk's AUX1, set :ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` to 22)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:38
#: f66390b23dcc4243a2a8187947a26a89
msgid "Connect the optional spinner to another output port and set SERVO*_FUNCTION or RC*_FUNCTION to 23 (i.e. if using a Pixhawk's AUX2, set :ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` to 23)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:39
#: 0af216addd3c46758c400596909577fb
msgid "To allow the pilot to turn on/off the sprayer set an auxiliary switch on an rc channel(``RCx_OPTION``) to \"15\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:42
#: c9e12b3d6a014a6789cf78dc729d4769
msgid "Configuring the pump"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:43
#: 979e391a50524966b3724a685818b77e
msgid "PWM range used to control the pump and spinner can be configured by setting the SERVO*_MIN/RC*_MIN, SERVO*_MAX/RC*_MAX parameters corresponding to the pwm output channels the pump and spinner are connected to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:44
#: ce91baaf6290432ba981376935ed0f0f
msgid ":ref:`SPRAY_PUMP_MIN <SPRAY_PUMP_MIN>` controls the minimum pump rate (expressed as a percentage).  By default this is 0% meaning the pump will completely stop if the vehicle stops."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:45
#: 088320089eb847d1ab2221e146b61285
msgid ":ref:`SPRAY_PUMP_RATE <SPRAY_PUMP_RATE>` controls the pump rate (expressed as a percentage) when the vehicle is travelling at 1m/s.  By default this is 10%.  The pump rate increases linearly with the vehicle speed meaning by default the pump will reach 100% at 10m/s."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:46
#: 05739dc5e8a3447cb9c3881388cd84a8
msgid ":ref:`SPRAY_SPINNER <SPRAY_SPINNER>` sets the pwm value sent to the spinner when the pump is on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sprayer.rst:47
#: db9f364ce4584f18bd3c8c2559252c98
msgid ":ref:`SPRAY_SPEED_MIN <SPRAY_SPEED_MIN>` sets the minimum vehicle speed (in cm/s) at which the pump will operate.  Default is 100 meaning the pump will begin when the vehicle is travelling at or above 1m/s."
msgstr ""
